      "type": "anchorbox",
      "title": "The Gatekeeper of Discipline",
      "description": "He guards the door to success (Ram Duaare Tum Rakhvare). Nothing worthwhile in life is achieved without passing through the gates of discipline. Hanuman represents the hard work, routine, and discipline required before anyone can attain mastery or peace.",
